From 66e711cab58cf118aa8a660f2d2f2a137f22b601 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Martins <372861+edulmartins@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:43:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] d221: describe the T8015 PCIe controller, its DARTs and the
 Wi-Fi port

Describe the two apcie DARTs and the H9P host bridge from the runtime
ADT, model pcie_ref and pcie_aux as clock gates on T8015, and wire the
d221 Wi-Fi slot on root port 3. The series is 0002-0005 in devices/t8015
(the backlight patch takes 0001), plus the T8015 compatible for the DART
and PCIe bindings.

The controller, its DARTs and the Wi-Fi port stay disabled by default;
the d221 board enables them in a later patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
